ons for common tasks. Client cards will include elegant avatars and a grid/table view toggle for data presentation. The Lucide icon library will be integrated for scalable vector graphics, using the CDN for reliability.\n\n\nA detailed UI breakdown will be performed, focusing on financial management-specific patterns. Each component, including contact badges, progress bars, and action buttons, will be designed for clarity and usability. The billing report will incorporate both POS ticket and formal invoice formats, with direct WhatsApp integration and print optimization. Forms will feature modern input styles with auto-calculation and quick preset options. Custom toast notifications will be implemented for user feedback.\n\nThe `styles.css` file will be examined to integrate the new font imports and custom POS styling. Custom styles will include options for ticket edges, tabular number alignment, and glassmorphism effects. The print stylesheet will be verified to ensure proper rendering.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"/* ==========================================================================\\n   ESTILOS PROFESIONALES - SISTEMA DE CONTROL DE CRÉDITOS Y COBRANZA (POS)\\n   ========================================================================== */\\n\\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\\n\\n:root {\\n  --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\\n  --primary-navy: #0f172a;\\n  --primary-surface: #ffffff;\\n}\\n\\nbody {\\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\\n  background-color: #f8fafc;\\n  color: #1e293b;\\n  font-feature-settings: \\\"cv02\\\", \\\"cv03\\\", \\\"cv04\\\", \\\"cv11\\\";\\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\\n}\\n\\n.font-mono-numbers {\\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n\\n/* Glassmorphism & Micro-elevations */\\n.glass-panel {\\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n  border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);\\n}\\n\\n.kpi-card {\\n  transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\\n  position: relative;\\n  overflow: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n.kpi-card:hover {\\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);\\n}\\n\\n.card-hover-pro {\\n  transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\\n}\\n\\n.card-hover-pro:hover {\\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\\n  box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.09), 0 6px 12px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);\\n}\\n\\n/* Scrollbar estilizada y discreta */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 6px;\\n  height: 6px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: #f1f5f9;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: #cbd5e1;\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: #94a3b8;\\n}\\n\\n/* Ticket POS estilizado */\\n.pos-ticket-paper {\\n  background: #ffffff;\\n  position: relative;\\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 25p\n<truncated 2920 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\SISTEMAS\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\control-creditos-comida\\\\styles.css\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
